{"branch":"가경점","html":"<section id=\"selected-directions\" class=\"km-directions\" aria-labelledby=\"selected-directions-title\" data-km-branch=\"가경점\"><h3 id=\"selected-directions-title\">찾아오시는 길</h3><p class=\"km-intro\">가경점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"km-map\" data-state=\"waiting\"><iframe data-km-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/maps/39s5zm95tdr.htm\" title=\"가경점 카카오 지도\" width=\"800\" height=\"398\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe><p class=\"km-map-status\">카카오 지도</p></div><div class=\"km-details\"><dl><dt>주소</dt><dd>충북 청주시 흥덕구 서현북로 18 2층 와와학습코칭학원</dd></dl><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 정류장</h4><ul><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">1</span>대원칸타빌</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">2</span>대원칸타빌</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">3</span>서현공원</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">4</span>서현공원</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">5</span>한라비발디아파트</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">6</span>용정마을</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">7</span>용정마을</li></ul></section><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 버스</h4><ul class=\"km-buses\"><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0101\">간선</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>814</span><span>815</span><span>853</span><span>702</span><span>813</span><span>812</span></span></li><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0102\">지선</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>416</span></span></li><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0108\">급행간선</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>B7</span><span>B7(비하종점-집현동)</span><span>B7(집현동-비하종점)</span></span></li></ul></section><p class=\"km-traffic-note\">주변 교통 정보는 제공된 카카오맵 약도 기준입니다. 노선과 정차 여부는 운행 상황에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.</p></div></section>"}